# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The developer guide is located at [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) in the root of this project’s repository. By participating, you are expected to uphold Qiskit’s [code of conduct](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"
msgstr "개발자 가이드는 이 프로젝트 저장소의 루트에 있는 [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-bosons/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)에 있습니다. 참여함으로써 Qiskit의 [행동 강령](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)을 지키는 데 동의하는 것으로 간주합니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
